            "name": "docs",
            "rank": 0
        },
        "AAQ": {
            "caption": "Define the input pattern using these placeholders: • 0: Digit only (0-9) • A: Letter only (a-z) • S: Alphanumeric (a-z, 0-9)  Any other character (like -, ., /, ( )) is treated as a fixed symbol and appears automatically.  Example: (000) 000-0000",
